# Generous Plunderer: "Whenever this creature attacks, it deals damage to defending player equal to the number of
# artifacts they control." For a creature attacking a planeswalker the defending player is the planeswalker's controller
# (CR 508.5). Bot2 casts Liliana of the Veil with a Swamp, a Mox Jet and a Mox Ruby, so it controls two artifacts: the
# Plunderer attacks Liliana, Bot2 takes 2 from the trigger (and no combat damage), and Liliana is dealt 2 by the
# Plunderer (loyalty 3 to 1). Bot1 declines the upkeep Treasure so that Bot2 holds only its two Moxen.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Generous Plunderer
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Liliana of the Veil
Swamp x16

